    "Here is a simple footnote[^1]. With some additional[^2] text after it.\n\n[^1]: My reference.\n[^2]: extra, other, supplementary\n": "<p>Here is a simple footnote<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup>. With some additional<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">2</a></sup> text after it.</p>\n<section data-footnotes=\"\" class=\"footnotes\"><h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>My reference. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>extra, other, supplementary <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n",
    "Here is a footnote reference,[^1] and another.[^longnote]\n\n[^1]: Here is the footnote.\n\n[^longnote]: Here's one with multiple blocks.\n\n    Subsequent paragraphs are indented to show that they\nbelong to the previous footnote.\n\n        { some.code }\n\n    The whole paragraph can be indented, or just the first\n    line.  In this way, multi-paragraph footnotes work like\n    multi-paragraph list items.\n\nThis paragraph won't be part of the note, because it\nisn't indented.\n": "<p>Here is a footnote reference,<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup> and another.<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-longnote-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-longnote-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">2</a></sup></p>\n<p>This paragraph won't be part of the note, because it<br>\nisn't indented.</p>\n<section data-footnotes=\"\" class=\"footnotes\"><h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>Here is the footnote. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-longnote-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>Here's one with multiple blocks.</p>\n<p>Subsequent paragraphs are indented to show that they<br>\nbelong to the previous footnote.</p>\n<pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">{ some.code }\n</code></pre>\n<p>The whole paragraph can be indented, or just the first<br>\nline.  In this way, multi-paragraph footnotes work like<br>\nmulti-paragraph list items. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-longnote-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n",
    "this should not work: ^[*inline* footnotes]! That's non-standard^[bad] syntax.": "<p>this should not work: ^[<em>inline</em> footnotes]! That's non-standard^[bad] syntax.</p>\n",
    "There are multiple[^1] references[^1] to the same footnote here.\n\n[^1]: The footnote in question (it[^1] can refer back to itself!)\n      Let's also reference another footnote[^2].\n[^2]: Hi!\n\nAnd in another paragraph[^1] too. Last but not least: bye![^2]\n": "<p>There are multiple<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup> references<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup> to the same footnote here.</p>\n<p>And in another paragraph<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1-4-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup> too. Last but not least: bye!<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-2-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">2</a></sup></p>\n<section data-footnotes=\"\" class=\"footnotes\"><h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>The footnote in question (it<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-1-3-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup> can refer back to itself!)<br>\nLet's also reference another footnote<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">2</a></sup>. <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1-2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9<sup>2</sup></a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1-3-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1-3\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9<sup>3</sup></a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-1-4-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1-4\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9<sup>4</sup></a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>Hi! <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-2-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 2-2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9<sup>2</sup></a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n",
    "# test\n\nWhat is this?[^test]\n\n[^test]: a test\n\n[^test-1]: duplicate\n\n# test\n\nanother[^test-1] paragraph[^test]\n": "<h1>test</h1>\n<p>What is this?<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-test-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-test-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup></p>\n<h1>test</h1>\n<p>another<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-test-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-test-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">2</a></sup> paragraph<sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-test-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-test-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup></p>\n<section data-footnotes=\"\" class=\"footnotes\"><h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-test-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>a test <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-test-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-test-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1-2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9<sup>2</sup></a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-test-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>duplicate <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-test-1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n",
    "Before: [^a]\n\n[^a]: first\n[^a]: second\n\nin the middle: [^a]\n\n[^a]: last\n\nSo which is it? [^a]\n": "<p>Before: <sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-a-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-a-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup></p>\n<p>in the middle: <sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-a-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-a-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup></p>\n<p>So which is it? <sup><a href=\"#user-content-fn-a-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" id=\"user-content-fnref-a-3-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-ref=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footnote-label\">1</a></sup></p>\n<section data-footnotes=\"\" class=\"footnotes\"><h2 id=\"footnote-label\" class=\"sr-only\">Footnotes</h2>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"user-content-fn-a-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\">\n<p>first <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-a-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9</a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-a-2-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1-2\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9<sup>2</sup></a> <a href=\"#user-content-fnref-a-3-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\" data-footnote-backref=\"\" aria-label=\"Back to reference 1-3\" class=\"data-footnote-backref\">\u21a9<sup>3</sup></a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n"
